Local adaptations for hermes monorepo skill-bundles and other OKF wikis:
  - Expanded type color palette (Skill Bundle Example, Concept, Paper, …)
  - Skip reserved OKF files index.md and log.md
  - Resolve absolute bundle-root links (/path.md) as graph edges
  - In-viewer navigation for relative markdown links in the detail panel
